From e84f5a9009ed989d2ef1c186c1629c8da0b27de3 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Jun Zhang <jun.zhang@arm.com>
Date: Mon, 24 Jul 2023 17:05:17 +0800
Subject: [PATCH] rss/kronos: Remove MCP from kronos platform

MCP is not needed in rdkronos platform, so remove it.
Also rebase the memory layout of safety island clusters
based on new rdfrement memory layout.

Upstream-Status: Pending
Signed-off-by: Jun Zhang <jun.zhang@arm.com>
Signed-off-by: Hongda Deng <Hongda.Deng@arm.com>
---
 bl2/ext/mcuboot/bl2_main.c                    |  4 -
 .../ext/target/arm/rss/kronos/CMakeLists.txt  |  1 -
 .../target/arm/rss/kronos/bl2/boot_hal_bl2.c  | 92 +------------------
 .../target/arm/rss/kronos/bl2/flash_map_bl2.c | 18 ----
 .../ext/target/arm/rss/kronos/config.cmake    |  1 -
